": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Long story short, having a TOML parser in Python stdlib would be great and tomli seems to be the best implementation available right now, so also the best candidate for stdlib. Would you be interested in trying to push it?\r\n\r\nThe relevant CPython bug is: https://bugs.python.org/issue40059", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/141/reactions", "total_count": 11, "+1": 11, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/141/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null, "score": 1.0}], "search_type": "lexical"}